Yes, ma'am!

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:42.420
Ms. Tsurusaki really is a wonderful teacher, isn't she?

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.380
Yeah! {Keep this one on a tiny bit longer too please.}

