Acting sho frightened of poor little me is jusht mean!

00:07:38.230 --> 00:07:41.300
There'sh no way she could be the third Precure!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:47.810
What do you think, Potpourri?

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:52.240
How about the girl over there doing shomething with the flowers?

