Well, if you're not a weirdo, what the heck's with you?!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.740
Well, um... um...

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:08.500
We're... I mean, I'm...

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:11.170
