00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.440
I take it from the way you were 
photographing them that you like flowers?

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.480
I do like flowers. As much as any girl would.

00:08:27.860 --> 00:08:30.610
In that case, I'd like to shcout you as a Precure!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:33.350
Me, a Precure?

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:39.560
Then again, that'd mean I could get an up-close
 and personal scoop on them whenever I wanted...

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.290
All right then, I've made up my mind! I'll become a Precure!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:43.710
I find her motives distasteful.

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:49.500
Let me confirm one thing: Have you had any dreams about a large tree?

00:08:49.500 --> 00:08:50.540
A tree?

