Excushe me.

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.330
Whoa! A weirdo!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:23.290
I'm not a weirdo! I'm a scout for the Precures.

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.500
A scout for the Precures?

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:28.970
Mish, I want you to become a Precure!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:32.550
Th-This is so sudden! I mean, 
I'm only really good at soccer...

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:37.010
There's no reason a Precure 
couldn't fight with a soccer ball!{There's no double negative in the Japanese, so it's more "It's perfectly acceptable for a Precure to fight with a soccer ball!" but this sounds better in English IMO?} {I could go either way, but I didn't see an issue with it in the first pass, so I'm fine with letting it sit.}

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:38.560
What?!

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.980
Mish, have you ever had any dreamsh about a large tree?

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.530
N-No, I haven't...

