So that's the trespasser!

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.950
It's a scoop! An honest-to-goodness scoop! {god -> goodness, as that's actually the more typical phrase in Americanese. Also girls, swearing, etc.}

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.660
This is a huge, huge, huge, <i>huge</i> scoop!

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:12.610
Is he an alien, or some kind of ghost?!

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:16.710
This mysterious figure who prowls the school grounds in search of the third Precure!

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:17.920
Huh?!

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:19.320
That couldn't be...

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:22.630
