00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.480
Right now, the teachers are searching the grounds for this trespasser.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.740
I have to go and join them, so none of you leave this room, all right?

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:43.910
Yes, ma'am...

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:02.720
O-Oh, it's just the tree's branches.

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:04.880
I'm so pathetic.

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.430
