00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:56.060
Why, you ask? Because I shall eliminate the third fairy here and now! {Old: la fée troisième! Too French. This is still pushing it a bit, I think, but I'll go with it.}

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:02.490
Desertrian, that's your cue!

00:14:08.290 --> 00:14:09.490
That's far enough!

00:14:09.940 --> 00:14:10.760
Tsubomi!

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.660
Erika!

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:16.210
