00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:29.890
Go forth, Seeds of the Precure!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.320
Precure!

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:35.850
Open My Heart!

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:23.570
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.810
Cure Blossom!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:34.440
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.930
Cure Marine!

00:15:43.190 --> 00:15:46.220
HeartCatch Precure!

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:07.610
I'm scared of ghoooosts!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.320
Huh?

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.030
Huh?!

00:16:09.030 --> 00:16:10.360
They're scary!

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.620
