I just want to be composed in front of my students.

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:23.430
But I'm just so scared of ghosts!

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:27.440
So that is what made the Flower of your Heart wilt so?

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.190
How laughable.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:33.170
It's because she has that ideal that she's suffering so much right now!

00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.070
You're just making a joke out of her,

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:38.530
and I've had it up to here with this!

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:49.880
Gather, Floral Power!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.550
Blossom Tact!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:56.970
Marine Tact!

00:18:02.340 --> 00:18:05.550
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:18:06.350 --> 00:18:11.850
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.050
