00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:47.980
Now then, let's give the Flower of her Heart back!

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.900
Tsubomi? Erika?

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:00.410
Are you all right?

00:19:00.410 --> 00:19:01.630
Y-Yes...

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:05.490
I think I saw a ghost, then passed out.

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:07.200
A ghost?

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.330
Yeah... {Extend this line a tad.}

00:19:08.330 --> 00:19:13.590
You probably won't believe me, but he was a long-haired man with the most terrible face.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.200
And then I had a dream where I turned into a ghost...

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:20.540
I'm so pathetic, aren't I?

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.030
I'm supposed to be an adult.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:24.300
You're not pathetic at all!

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:25.900
That's right, Ms. Tsurusaki!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:28.390
I don't think it matters if you're 
scared of ghosts, even as an adult.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.900
You're really amazing, Ms. Tsurusaki!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:36.900
Everyone in our class loves you too!

00:19:37.780 --> 00:19:38.840
That so?

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:40.750
Thank you.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:47.080
I love you all too, you know? Every last student who's in my care.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:50.710
We know!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.690
Well then, shall we head back to the classroom?

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:58.520
She's a really fantastic teacher.

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:03.210
Everyone in this school is connected by the trust they have in each other.{Shrinking a little to fit on one line.}

00:20:03.210 --> 00:20:04.550
Trust?

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.120
Trust...

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.180
Trust!

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:09.860
That's sho beautiful.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.230
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born.

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:30.770
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:34.620
So that's what happened.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.710
Sounds like it was a lot of trouble.

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:39.470
In the language of flowers, a
 hymenanthes means "dignity."

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:42.920
She might be afraid of ghosts, but Ms. Tsurusaki really is brilliant!

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:46.890
But still, pretending to be a scout for the Precures...

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:49.100
It's not something to laugh about!

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:51.370
It caused us a ton of trouble!

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.640
It really did.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.310
The high school's been in an uproar over it too.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.870
But I wouldn't have believed it was the work of a new fairy.

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.570
I feel really shtrong powers from inshide you!

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:08.520
You musht be the third Precure!

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.790
That's right! It could be Yuri!

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:14.740
With Potpourri's help, you can become a Precure again!

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.920
Pleashe, I'm begging you!

