00:21:27.290 --> 00:21:31.640
your destined partner isn't someone you can find by just scouting them out.

00:21:32.610 --> 00:21:39.300
Once you and your partner are connected by a 
strong bond of trust, the third Precure will be born.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.480
Shure!

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:50.410
But just who could the third Precure be?

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:51.620
Hrm...

00:21:53.860 --> 00:21:58.230
